{11}{No time!  No time!  I'm just an old wizard...my name is Cyrus and I've lived here in Stillwater for years!  I was captured by Drog Black Tooth the ogre, and now he's planning to dine on my bones!  Please!  Get me out of here...}{No time!  No time!  I'm just an old wizard...my name is Cyrus and I've lived here in Stillwater for years!  I was captured by Drog Black Tooth the ogre, and now he's planning to dine on my bones!  Please!  Get me out of here...}{}{}{}{}
